Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 10:47:52 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1106/1198] Languages, tips and the take's way out (1148):
 heresy-i18n.js (catalogs keyed by the page's English, text and the attributes
 people read, the language kept with the settings, no English flash on a
 reload, the bar's button, the logo's words in seven languages); a tip for
 every control of the studio's rooms (28 that say all in their label listed in
 help.js); the remaster's preset and de-esser off where they do nothing;
 Export to DAW in a take's menu, on every take; no stray selection, Ctrl+A
 only in a field; the check box in the play column; WORKSPACE leaves the bar
 with the logo's words, room names never wrap, the ResizeObserver note no page
 error; the cheat-sheet's verdicts and the shofar probes' prompts; OpenRouter
 calls titled Ruach Studio

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
